{"sections":[{"estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"title":"Going further with more resources","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","chapter":"Go further with more ressources","backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}]}],"kind":"hero"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"anchor":"More-resources","contentSection":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"title":"More resources","stepsSection":[{"code":null,"type":"step","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as librairies) with details about everyhting: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","runtimePreview":null},{"code":null,"type":"step","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is also a